    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "41 College Vale, Mullingar, Co Westmeath N91 K5A2\r\n\r\nA beautifully presented home in one of Mullingar’s most sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nNo. 41 College Vale is an exceptional four-bedroom semi-detached residence, presented to the market in immaculate condition. Combining generous accommodation, excellent bedroom space and a highly convenient location, this property is ideally suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nSituated in the popular College Vale development, the property enjoys an enviable position close to St Finian’s College, Mullingar General Hospital and Mullingar town centre, while also offering easy access to the M4 motorway and surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\n No. 41 College Vale represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a superb family home in a prime residential setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n4.95m x 2.10m\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner\r\n5.75m x 3.35m\r\nA bright and practical family kitchen/dining space featuring fitted kitchen units, tiled floors and walls, electric oven and hob, and patio doors opening onto the rear garden/patio area.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n2.85m x 2.00m\r\nWell-appointed utility with fitted units, sink unit, tiled flooring and walls, and plumbing for washer/dryer.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.55m x 5.65m\r\nA spacious and comfortable reception room with timber flooring, attractive bay window and solid-fuel stove, creating a warm and inviting family living space.\r\n\r\nDS Bedroom:\r\n4.65m x 2.85m\r\nGenerous bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.85m x 1.55m\r\nFully tiled, incorporating WC, wash hand basin and electric shower.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n3.35m x 2.15m\r\nCarpeted landing with hotpress and immersion.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n4.10m x 3.10m\r\nGenerous double bedroom with fitted carpet and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.75m x 0.85m\r\nFully tiled ensuite incorporating WC, wash hand basin and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.20m x 3.55m\r\nWell-proportioned bedroom with built-in wardrobe and timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.55m x 2.40m\r\nBedroom with built-in wardrobe and timber flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n2.15m x 1.20m\r\nFully tiled bathroom with WC, wash hand basin and bath.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCollege Vale – A Highly Sought-After Residential Address\r\n\r\nCollege Vale is a highly regarded residential location in Mullingar, offering an excellent setting for family life.\r\nNo. 41 is ideally positioned within easy reach of schools, healthcare, shops, leisure facilities and Mullingar town centre, while commuters will appreciate convenient access to the M4 motorway.\r\n\r\nThe combination of a desirable residential setting and excellent local connectivity makes this an outstanding location for both families and commuters.\r\n\r\nNo. 41 College Vale offers the discerning purchaser a rare opportunity to acquire a turn-key family home in pristine condition, requiring little or no immediate work.\r\n\r\nThe generous accommodation, four bedrooms, excellent presentation and sought-after location combine to create a property of genuine appeal.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tImmaculately presented throughout\r\n•\tPrime residential location\r\n•\tFour bedrooms\r\n•\tDownstairs bedroom with ensuite\r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows and doors\r\n•\tC1 BER energy rating\r\n•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\t Parking\r\n•\tRear Garden\r\n•\tKitchen/diner with patio doors to garden\r\n•\tUtility room\r\n•\tSitting room with bay window and solid-fuel stove\r\n•\tBuilt-in wardrobes\r\n•\tClose to St Finian’s School and Mullingar General Hospital\r\n•\tConvenient to Mullingar town centre and all amenities\r\n•\tExcellent access to the M4 motorway\r\n•\tIdeal family home"
      },
